  title: Tutorial
  message: 'Keep in mind your health and ammo (top left on the game scene).


    You
    can defend to block all damage.

    You can heal to fully restore your health
    (but if enemies attack you during this time it will get canceled).

    You can
    reload one bullet at a time as well.'
